🌟 4. Reflection / Self-Check

Kya main bhi maal aur duniya ki mohabbat mein Allah ko bhool raha hoon?
Kya main Allah ka shukriya roz karta hoon?
Kya meri niyyat saaf hai ya sirf dikhawa?
Kya main akhirat ke liye tayyar hoon?

